### Search places by name and city
GET http://localhost:5000/places/searchPlace?name=pyramid
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Search places by category only
GET http://localhost:5000/places/searchPlace?name=pyramid&city=Giza
Content-Type: application/json
###

### Search all places (بدون فلاتر)
GET http://localhost:5000/places/searchPlace
Content-Type: application/json

### Create new driver (admin only)
POST http://localhost:5000/driver
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6IjY4Mzg0ZDllNTQ5OTJiMzExZmZhZGYzYSIsImlhdCI6MTc1MDAwODgyNywiZXhwIjoxNzU3Nzg0ODI3fQ.sH8JjngtdL8hQlfLss6kUm8JRu3iLL79CckZWFv7vyU

{
  "name": "Mohamed Driver",
  "phone": "01123456789",
  "hasCar": true,
  "carType": "Toyota Corolla",
  "pricePerHour": 150,
  "profileImage": "https://example.com/driver.jpg",
  "isAvailable": true
}

### Create new review for a place (user only)
